From 355c200a9b67cd3ecb48cadd278eeb4125a5b1da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jimmy <minhdangoz94@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:41:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add KM7 (Mecool, S905Y4/S4/AP222) board support

Ports the KM7 board target off the existing kvim1s S4 build, with its
own defconfig, board files, and DDR3 timing (VIM1S is LPDDR4). Also
adds a SARADC-based adc_update_key recovery path in km7.h alongside
the existing GPIOD_8 GPIO check, since GPIOD_8 does not reproduce the
stock AP222 physical recovery button.

Change-Id: I6f8f4e9800c0a3774304fb9ec4699025393f4e49
---
 bl33z/Makefile                        |    3 +
 board/khadas/Kconfig                  |   11 +
 board/khadas/configs/km7.h            |  520 ++++++
 board/khadas/defconfigs/km7_defconfig |  133 ++
 board/khadas/km7/Kconfig              |   24 +
 board/khadas/km7/Makefile             |    1 +
 board/khadas/km7/firmware/timing.c    | 2309 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 board/khadas/km7/fw_arb.cfg           |   26 +
 board/khadas/km7/km7.c                |  410 +++++
 9 files changed, 3437 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/configs/km7.h
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/defconfigs/km7_defconfig
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/km7/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/km7/Makefile
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/km7/firmware/timing.c
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/km7/fw_arb.cfg
 create mode 100644 board/khadas/km7/km7.c

diff --git a/bl33z/Makefile b/bl33z/Makefile
index 6998e6b30a..d237a17e43 100644
--- a/bl33z/Makefile
+++ b/bl33z/Makefile
@@ -90,6 +90,9 @@ endif
